<section class="about-intro">
    <h1>About Us</h1>

    <p>
        We are a team of student researchers from <strong>Quezon City Science High School</strong> dedicated to developing innovative agricultural solutions. Through our project, <strong>AR-RICE</strong>, we use artificial intelligence and robotics to detect and trap rice pests, helping farmers protect their crops, reduce losses, and promote sustainable farming.
    </p>
</section>

